request.description:
> 🚧 Special privileges required
>
> Private Scanning endpoints are only available to users with Private Scanning license.

This endpoint return information about a file scanned privately. Notice that it only accepts SHA-256 as the file's ID, MD5 and SHA-1 are not supported like in its GET /files/{id} public counterpart. The SHA-256 for the analysed file can be computed by yourself or obtained from the response to the call to GET /analyses/{id}.

```json Example response
{
"data": {
"attributes": {
"sha1": "7bae8076a5771865123be7112468b79e9d78a640",
"magic": "ASCII text",
"tags": [
"text"
],
"exiftool": {
"MIMEType": "text/plain",
"LineCount": "1",
"MIMEEncoding": "us-ascii",
"FileTypeExtension": "txt",
"FileType": "TXT",
"WordCount": "1",
"Newlines": "Unix LF"
},
"trid": [
{
"file_type": "file seems to be plain text/ASCII",
"probability": 0.0
}
],
"vhash": "9eecb7db59d16c80417c72d1e1f4fbf1",
"sha256": "11a77c3d96c06974b53d7f40a577e6813739eb5c811b2a86f59038ea90add772",
"ssdeep": "3:tdn:T",
"md5": "e5828c564f71fea3a12dde8bd5d27063",
"size": 5
},
"type": "private_file",
"id": "11a77c3d96c06974b53d7f40a577e6813739eb5c811b2a86f59038ea90add772",
"links": {
"self": "https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/private/files/11a77c3d96c06974b53d7f40a577e6813739eb5c811b2a86f59038ea90add772"
}
}
}
```

> 🚧 Special privileges required
>
> Private Scanning endpoints are only available to users with Private Scanning license.

Reanalyses a private file. The same params from /files (other than the file) are accepted. Returns a private analysis.

```json Example
{
"data": {
"type": "private_analysis",
"id": "ZmI5Y2VmNGJmZDIwZTkzNmQ5MzY0NTcwMGI2Nzc2M2Q6Tm9uZToxNjYwODI1NDE1"
}
}
```

> 🚧 Special privileges required
>
> Private Scanning endpoints are only available to users with Private Scanning license.

Returns a list of previously analysed private files. The files are always ordered by SHA256.

```json /api/v3/private/files
{
"meta": {
"cursor": ,
"count":
},
"data": {
,
,
...
},
"links": {
"self": ,
"next":
}
}
```
```json
{
"meta": {
"cursor": "079b1db08ac52c94be8fdb5b638134a6109a510bc10a87c15413d6c793985678",
"count": 19
},
"data": [
{
"attributes": {
"type_description": "Windows Installer",
...
